🟡 中危 问题2 — isChildActive 硬编码路由特判，新增路由即失效
文件：frontend/src/layouts/AppLayout.vue　位置：见相关片段
问题描述：触发条件：新增 /equipment/xxx 或 /quality-management/xxx 子路由时。isChildActive 用 6 个 if 对 /equipment/ledger、/quality-management 做 startsWith 特判，属于「路由补丁堆叠」。一旦新增同级路由（如 /equipment/spare-parts），父项高亮会误判，且维护者需再次追加 if。属可维护性/设计缺陷，非立即故障。
// ❌ 当前代码
```
function isChildActive(path) {
  if (route.path === path) return true
  if (!route.path.startsWith(path + '/')) return false
  if (path === '/equipment/ledger' && route.path.startsWith('/equipment/inspection')) {
    return false
  }
  if (path === '/equipment/ledger' && route.path.startsWith('/equipment/maintenance-')) {
    return false
  }
  if (path === '/equipment/ledger' && route.path.startsWith('/equipment/repairs')) {
    return false
  }
  if (path === '/equipment/ledger' && route.path.startsWith('/equipment/ledger/')) {
    return true
  }
  if (path === '/quality-management' && route.path.startsWith('/quality-management/inspection-')) {
    return false
  }
  return true
}
```
修改建议：改为「精确匹配 + 最长前缀匹配」的通用算法：收集所有菜单 path，取与当前 route.path 前缀匹配且最长者作为唯一 active 项。验证：访问 /equipment/inspection，确认仅「设备点检」高亮、「设备台账」不高亮；新增任意子路由后无需改此函数。
// ✅ 正确做法
```
// 在 menuGroups 计算后收集全部叶子 path
const allMenuPaths = computed(() => {
  const paths = []
  const walk = (items) => {
    for (const it of items) {
      if (it.path) paths.push(it.path)
      if (it.children) walk(it.children)
    }
  }
  menuGroups.value.forEach((g) => walk(g.items))
  return paths
})

// 最长前缀匹配，天然避免父项误高亮
const activeMenuPath = computed(() => {
  const cur = route.path
  let best = ''
  for (const p of allMenuPaths.value) {
    if (cur === p || cur.startsWith(p + '/')) {
      if (p.length > best.length) best = p
    }
  }
  return best
})

function isChildActive(path) {
  return activeMenuPath.value === path
}
```
